  seoTitle: "Islamic Story for Kids About Patience | Noor",
  seoDescription: "A gentle Islamic story for kids about patience — Sara counts her grandfather's green mangoes every morning and learns why good things cannot be rushed.",
  slug: "patience-green-mango",
  lesson: "Patience",
  ages: "Ages 4–8",
  mins: "3 min read",
  summary: "Sara watches her grandfather's mango tree every single morning. The mangoes are still green — and Sara is tired of waiting. A patient grandfather, one little watering can, and the sweetest lesson of the summer.",
